Description: NoteKeeper (notes, todos, vault)
 Self-hosted notes, todos, and password vault with a bundled web UI.
 GraalVM native image — no JVM at runtime. amd64, x86-64-v2.
 .
 After install: http://<host>:<port> (debconf asks URL, port, DB, optional OAuth).
